{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10106130","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10106130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1010613001:2":{"text":"あなたたち、このブドウ畑は一体なんなんですか！？","source_cn":"你们，这片葡萄田是怎么回事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFFA1678A89F8D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1010613002:2":{"text":"……落ち着けよ、いきなり興奮してどうしたんだ？","source_cn":"……你冷静点，怎么突然这么激动？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0D9C93587208CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010613003:1":{"text":"フランツ様が捕まったって噂を流したのはお前たちか？","source_cn":"就是你们传言说弗朗茨老爷被逮捕了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBE65A7E36FB313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010613004:1":{"text":"冗談だろ。あれだけ金持ちで、各地の貴族とも懇意にしてる人が簡単に逮捕されるわけがない。","source_cn":"笑话，他家财万贯，和各方贵族都有往来，怎么会那么简单入狱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433D8052803BCAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010613005:1":{"text":"フランツ様が釈放されたら、俺たちにも捜査の手が及ぶだろ。面倒事を起こすんじゃねぇ！","source_cn":"等弗朗茨老爷被放出来，就该盘查我们的工作了，别来惹麻烦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9264CDEC5EDC236B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010613006:1":{"text":"答えてください。このブドウもフランツが植えたものなんですか！？いつ植えたんです！？","source_cn":"回答我，这些葡萄也是弗朗茨种的吗？！什么时候？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA387E1E6170B2204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010613007:0":{"text":"前に働いてた人から聞いた話だと、<style=\"highlight\">三年前</style>に黒い服の女とフランツ様が一緒に……","source_cn":"听之前换班的人说，<style=highlight>三...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E61674D7F06E59B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010613008:1":{"text":"黙れ、何も喋るな！\n質問に答える義務などない、失せろ！","source_cn":"闭嘴，别什么都往外说！\\n我们没义务回答你，快滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E2FAF156A7C691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010613009:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">三年前</style>って、南村でブドウの大規模栽培が始まる前……！？<style=\"highlight\">ボクの故郷</style>が……","source_cn":"<style=highlight>三年前，</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080D68BE9FB2A764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1010613009":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">三年前</style>って、南村でブドウの大規模栽培が始まる前……！？<style=\"highlight\">ボクの故郷</style>が……","source_cn":"<style=highlight>三年前，</style>那就是在南村大规模种植葡萄之前……？！在<style=highlight>我的家乡</style>被——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080D68BE9FB2A764","variant_stat